    <briefdescription>
<para>Class representing a grid of ground points on the surface of a celestial body. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classastrea_1_1trace_1_1Grid" kindref="compound">Grid</ref> class manages a collection of ground points, allowing for various grid configurations such as uniform, equal area, and weighted grids. It provides methods to iterate over the ground stations and access their properties.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>_body_</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The celestial body NTTP this grid resides on. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
